VERDICT
============================================================================================
  FAILURES 0.
  wall 500s, 3000 reps per scale, seed 20260831

  The click stays CORRECT and stays FREE: its expected delta is positive at every scale,
  and the two priced mis-click pairs are an order of magnitude worse the other way.
  What this measures is that the ONE realisation arriving tonight cannot GRADE it. The
  sd of the delta is comparable to the delta itself, so a private board that happens to
  favour the auto pair is not evidence the CV pick was wrong.
  BOUNDED BY: bootstrapping OOF rows models the test set as a finite sample from the
  same distribution. It does not model train/test shift, and it is not the common-shift
  null used for the rank forecast -- that instrument lives in w135_prereg.txt P3.
